              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa kakanza kuamba ne, Nenjimishe dina dia Isalele muinshi mua diulu, kadi yeye wakatuma Yalobama, muana wa Yoasha, bua kubasungileye.",
          "type": "text",
